    TutorialSteps:
    - message: Some battles involve controlling many units. You can use the Breakpoint
        by <b>dragging it between portraits to freeze actions at your desired point
        in time</b>.
      uiElement: 0
    - message: When you Play out the level, actions before the Breakpoint occur as
        normal. <b>Actions after it are paused and can be reordered</b>. Press Play
        again to continue the second sequence. Be careful, as Breakpoints <b>cannot
        be moved after the first sequence</b> has occured.
      uiElement: 1
